From u6ad895aa93bfdc63 at groups.google.com  Fri Feb 21 23:24:48 2025
From: u6ad895aa93bfdc63 at groups.google.com (John C)
Date: Fri, 21 Feb 2025 23:24:48 +0000
Subject: Re: Calculating derived statistics as in BPA 2012 seems wrong?
Message-ID: <w1-UAWo2a1U.SI9NRYOgAQAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <w1-UAWo2a1U.mCEDQn6UAQAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
References: <w1-UAWo2a1U.ezCQPfzZAAAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com> <w1-UAWo2a1U.mCEDQn6UAQAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
